      "level": 1,
      "text": "1. Executive summary"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Alder Street Press closed 2025 with revenue of $22,169k, up 19.2% on $18,602k the year before. APAC grew fastest (+24.3%), while EMEA moved at +7.6%. The strongest quarter was Q2."
