    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cloud Sync was the standout (+16.6%). Mobile needs attention (-0.7%)."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "3.1 Product notes"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Studio"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Studio earned $3,195k (+0.6%) at a 71% gross margin, contributing 17% of product revenue. Margin is above the blended average, so growth here is welcome."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Cloud Sync"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cloud Sync earned $2,078k (+16.6%) at a 75% gross margin, contributing 11% of product revenue. Margin is above the blended average, so growth here is welcome."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Review Suite"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Review Suite earned $3,834k (+12.0%) at a 64% gross margin, contributing 21% of product revenue. Margin is below the blended average, so growth here dilutes profit."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Mobile"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mobile earned $4,106k (-0.7%) at a 79% gross margin, contributing 22% of product revenue. Revenue fell, and it is a high-margin line, so the loss hurts profit."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "API"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "API earned $5,200k (+11.9%) at a 62% gross margin, contributing 28% of product revenue. Margin is below the blended average, so growth here dilutes profit."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "4. Risks and mitigations"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The main risks, in the order we would address them:"
    },
    {
      "type": "numbered",
      "items": [
        "Concentration. APAC is 56% of revenue; a slowdown there moves the whole result.",
        "Weak region. EMEA grew +7.6%; review pricing and partners.",
        "Product drag. Mobile shrank relative to the others; decide whether to invest or sunset.",
        "Churn. Churned accounts in the ledger show where renewals are slipping.",
        "Seasonality. Results lean on one quarter; smooth the pipeline to avoid a weak start to next year."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "5. Outlook"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We plan for $25,994k in 2026 (+17.3%), led by APAC. Gross margin is expected to hold near 69%."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "italic": true,
      "text": "Note: all numbers in this document are synthetic, generated from a seed for demonstration."
